---
description: "SQL Server schema and migration constraints."
alwaysApply: false
globs: "**/migrations/**/*.sql,**/queries/**/*.sql,**/db/**/*.{ts,js,py,cs},**/models/**/*.{ts,js,py,cs}"
---

# DB SQL Server

- Use migrations for all schema changes.
- Plan rollback paths or declare irreversible changes.
- Index for critical query paths.
- Use transactions for multi-step changes.
